A valkyrie is interested, sure enough... but very few (if any) classes
need it less than she does.  Her starting shield, plus the remains of an
unfortunate dwarf or two (you may need to off several to get mithril),
will do quite nicely for armour until she's got the resources to pillage
the Magic Memory Vaults and/or Ludicrous and/or sell piles of junk.  (With
a valkyrie, or other high-Strength high-Con characters, I often collect
all the armour and weapons I can possibly manage without going burdened
while heading through the mines to Minetown.)

Lawful valkyries have it particularly easy; at 5th (I think; maybe 6th)
they can dip their starting longsword in fountains to obtain Excalibur.
